{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深水埗發生高空墮物事件。今日（26日）下午3時50分，警方接獲報案，指福榮街90號一大廈有一扇鋁窗從天而降，直墮地面，幸無人受傷。警方經調查後，拘捕一名男子，涉嫌「容許物件從高處墮下」。</p><p>現場圖片可見，涉事鋁窗跌於馬路中，玻璃粉碎四散一地，窗框嚴重扭曲變形，部分鋁條更折斷脫落；警員事後封鎖涉事位置，以防發生危險。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事銀色鋁窗墮地後嚴重扭曲變形，部分鋁條折斷脫落，地上遺有玻璃碎片。（threads@fortumecomenow）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202687419090997248281430.jpeg/7EAOMU81uBBSfvwjdPNF577lE20B-HHUtrT5-La0-fg\"/><figcaption>涉事銀色鋁窗墮地後嚴重扭曲變形，部分鋁條折斷脫落，地上遺有玻璃碎片。（threads@fortumecomenow）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖涉事位置，以防市民靠近。（threads@lokpy_lee）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202688466006052864460712.jpeg/7QT2f7i3ZFzIAZsY2vTBbFzt6GiJG8ZCRCo7sEQqO7A\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖涉事位置，以防市民靠近。（threads@lokpy_lee）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"深水埗福榮街90號有鋁窗懷疑甩脫飛墮街上。（threads@fortumecomenow）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202688689151414272715892.jpeg/n3XvXD_XtIWu6yFJ1IpCL4_QA-tv_AmLk2Mh5ZNjIeU\"/><figcaption>深水埗福榮街90號有鋁窗懷疑甩脫飛墮街上。（threads@fortumecomenow）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事銀色鋁窗墮地後嚴重扭曲變形，部分鋁條折斷脫落，地上遺有玻璃碎片。（threads＠fortumecomenow）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202689818211913728490318.jpeg/y13iR5s45GeJ4UpgWfzSFfIx5i6z7yRWFuwX2BbsF9g\"/><figcaption>涉事銀色鋁窗墮地後嚴重扭曲變形，部分鋁條折斷脫落，地上遺有玻璃碎片。（threads＠fortumecomenow）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事銀色鋁窗墮地後嚴重扭曲變形，部分鋁條折斷脫落，地上遺有玻璃碎片。（threads＠fortumecomenow）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202689821093531648573248.jpeg/CohvgzG5HSUE6C1TLIMTUdxcUFB7vUZYlQqc8JUKnPA\"/><figcaption>涉事銀色鋁窗墮地後嚴重扭曲變形，部分鋁條折斷脫落，地上遺有玻璃碎片。（threads＠fortumecomenow）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:04:28.705032+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":416,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:35:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:57:57.008620+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:41.513598+00:0